OAB - First responders (FR) experience unique work and health challenges, including 
      different exposures and triggers to potentially psychologically traumatic events 
      (PPTE) at work.It is important to develop and implement effective and accessible 
      workplace programs to reduce work disability.Program implementation is a 
      challenge for FR organizations therefore rehabilitation professionals should 
      provide guidance and support in both program development and 
      implementation.Sufficient resources (staff, training, evaluation) should be 
      allocated to better support post-traumatic stress injury (PTSI) program 
      implementation in FR organizations.
